### Gaps vs [`docs/product-architecture.md`](docs/product-architecture.md)

Need publishing flags (`is_publicly_published`, `featured`, `public_sort_order`, `public_slug`), alternate image URLs on the row, `live_sku` for the OG2164-SPF discrepancy, and new `wholesale_order_requests` (+ line snapshots).

### Security

**Do not** open anon `SELECT` on `catalog_items` (would leak sales notes, overrides, `field_meta`, buyer feedback). Use a **restricted view/RPC** for published public columns only. Submit via a validated public API into new tables.

