## Implementation plan

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  homepage[Homepage CTA] --> collection["/old-guys-rule-wholesale"]
  collection --> detail["/old-guys-rule-wholesale/slug"]
  collection --> rpc[Public OGR products RPC/view]
