```

### Phase 1 — Schema + public access
- Add publishing columns + `alternate_image_urls` + `live_sku` fields on `catalog_items`
- Backfill slugs; **auto-publish active OGR rows that already have `primary_image_url`** so the showroom isn’t empty (staff can unpublish)
- Create `public_old_guys_rule_products` view (or RPCs) with **approved columns only**; grant anon read **on that projection only**
- Create `wholesale_order_requests` + `wholesale_order_request_items` (immutable price/qty snapshots, statuses per architecture)

### Phase 2 — Public UI
- [`/old-guys-rule-wholesale`](src/pages/old-guys-rule-wholesale/index.astro) + [`/[slug].astro`](src/pages/old-guys-rule-wholesale/[slug].astro) with `prerender = false` (SSR)
- New `src/components/wholesale/*`: grid, card, detail/gallery, filters (URL query params), order builder, buyer form
- Organic tokens; labeled currencies (`US$… wholesale`, `Suggested retail C$…`); estimated landed CAD only when settings support it, clearly labeled
- Homepage: point OGR CTA to `/old-guys-rule-wholesale` (copy: “View Wholesale Collection” if it fits); leave Busted Knuckles alone

### Phase 3 — Submit + staff controls
- `POST /api/wholesale/order-requests`: validation, honeypot, rate limit; match/create prospect (never auto-activate); `prospect_updates` activity; source `old-guys-rule-wholesale`
- Email confirmation if/when Resend is available; otherwise CRM activity is the system of record
- Drawer: Published / Featured / Sort / Slug / Preview & copy public link

### Phase 4 — Quality
- Tests for public field stripping, filters, slug 404, MOQ, submit → CRM
- `npm run check`; desktop/mobile visual pass; architecture delivery report

### Out of scope (MVP)
Payment, buyer accounts, live inventory, auto freight/duty quotes, retailer price lists, cloud carts, PDF line sheets.

